<< <https://k.loria.fr/ontologies/architectureonto-individuals#equiformer_v3_mp_variant> <https://k.loria.fr/ontologies/architectureonto#hasParameterNumber> "30278113"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer> >> prov:wasDerivedFrom "YAML model_params: 30278113." ; dcterms:source <https://arxiv.org/pdf/2604.09130.pdf> .
