<< <https://k.loria.fr/ontologies/architectureonto-individuals#equiformer_v3_mp_equiformerv3_model_variant> <https://k.loria.fr/ontologies/architectureonto#hasMachineLearningArchitecture> <https://k.loria.fr/ontologies/architectureonto-individuals#equiformer_v3_mp_equiformerv3_architecture> >> prov:wasDerivedFrom "PDF context: 'SE(3)-equivariant graph attention Transformer' — a Transformer operating on graphs. Ontology: GraphTransformerArchitecture is a subclass of TransformerArchitecture." ; dcterms:source <https://arxiv.org/pdf/2604.09130.pdf> .
<< <https://k.loria.fr/ontologies/architectureonto-individuals#equiformer_v3_mp_equiformerv3_architecture> <https://k.loria.fr/ontologies/architectureonto#hasParameterNumber> "30278113"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer> >> prov:wasDerivedFrom "YAML model_params: 30278113 (for the base OC20 model). PDF Table 1 Index 7 shows 91M for the full SwiGLU-S2 variant; YAML reports 30278113 as the canonical parameter count." ; dcterms:source <https://arxiv.org/pdf/2604.09130.pdf> .
<< <https://k.loria.fr/ontologies/architectureonto-individuals#equiformer_v3_mp_equiformerv3_architecture_configuration> <https://k.loria.fr/ontologies/architectureonto#hasLayerCount> "8"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer> >> prov:wasDerivedFrom "PDF Appendix Table 8: Number of Transformer blocks N=8 for the base OC20 model." ; dcterms:source <https://arxiv.org/pdf/2604.09130.pdf> .
<< <https://k.loria.fr/ontologies/architectureonto-individuals#equiformer_v3_mp_equiformerv3_architecture_configuration> <https://k.loria.fr/ontologies/architectureonto#hasHiddenDimension> "512"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer> >> prov:wasDerivedFrom "PDF Appendix Table 8: Hidden dimension in feedforward networks after SwiGLU-S2 dffn = (6, 512), so hidden dimension is 512." ; dcterms:source <https://arxiv.org/pdf/2604.09130.pdf> .
<< <https://k.loria.fr/ontologies/architectureonto-individuals#equiformer_v3_mp_equiformerv3_architecture> <https://k.loria.fr/ontologies/architectureonto#hasComponent> <https://k.loria.fr/ontologies/architectureonto-individuals#equiformerv3_equivariantmergedlayernormalization_component> >> prov:wasDerivedFrom "PDF Section 4 and Figure 1: Transformer blocks consist of equivariant merged layer normalization, equivariant graph attention, feedforward networks. SwiGLU-S2 is the activation function. eSCN convolutions are used. Embedding and Output Head are described in Appendix A." ; dcterms:source <https://arxiv.org/pdf/2604.09130.pdf> .
